flowchart TD
    phone[Phone playing music] --> spotify[Spotify user account / Web API]
    spotify --> adapter[Python metadata adapter (poll)]
    demo[Offline demo track generator] --> adapter2[Demo adapter]
    adapter --> state[Normalized TrackState]
    adapter2 --> state
    state --> api[localhost HTTP /api/state]
    api --> ui[Chromium kiosk / HDMI album-art screen]
    state --> intent[Ambient light policy / mock output]
    intent -. Future hardware implementation .-> gpio[GPIO18 → 74AHCT125 → WS2812B]
    audio[Music audio signal] -. NOT available via Spotify metadata API .-> beats[Future audio analyzer / source to be designed]
    beats -. Future only .-> gpio
    airplay[Optional AirPlay receiver with metadata] -. Future architecture branch .-> state
